    "安全检查通过：ComfyUI 只监听 127.0.0.1，公网打不开，没有陌生任务。": "Security check passed: ComfyUI listens only on 127.0.0.1, is unreachable from the internet, and there are no unknown jobs.",
    "安全告警：发现不是本插件提交的任务或可疑文件": "Security alert: found jobs not submitted by this plugin, or suspicious files",
    "建议：拉回已完成的成片，然后立即停机，这台机器不要再复用。如果是你自己在 ComfyUI 网页里提交的任务，可以忽略。": "Recommended: pull back the finished results, then stop the GPU right away and do not reuse this machine. If you submitted the job yourself in the ComfyUI web page, you can ignore this.",
    外观: "Appearance",
    "已配置，输入新值可替换": "Set; type a new value to replace it",
