    "正在查找账号里的机器…": "Looking for instances in your account…",
    "账号里还没有合适的机器：到「开始」让插件建一台，或在优云智算控制台自己建一台再点「重新查找」。插件从不删除机器。": 'Your account has no suitable machine yet. Let the plugin make one in "Start", or create one yourself in the compshare console and click "Search again". The plugin never deletes a machine.',
