    "只有这一台合适，已自动选上。": "This is the only suitable one, so it was selected automatically.",
    "在账号里找到 {n} 台。能跑 Shisei 的要 48G 显存。": "Found {n} in your account. Shisei needs 48G of GPU memory.",
