    "跑完后空闲 10 分钟自动停机；跑着时平台定时关机始终在 30 分钟内，dsh 关了也会停。插件只停机，不删除机器或磁盘。": "Idle machines stop by themselves after 10 minutes; while working, the platform scheduled stop is always within 30 minutes, so the machine stops even with dsh closed. The plugin only stops machines; it never deletes a machine or disk.",
