    "shisei.indaloop.app 上素材库的格式比这个插件新，升级 dsh-shisei 后就能用。": "The library on shisei.indaloop.app uses a newer format than this plugin. Update dsh-shisei to use it.",
    "连不上 shisei.indaloop.app：看一下网络（会用系统的代理设置），过一会儿再打开这一页。": "Cannot reach shisei.indaloop.app. Check your network (the system proxy settings are used) and open this page again in a while.",
    "自动从 shisei.indaloop.app 读取，不用设置，只列适合所有人看的素材。用到项目里的图才会下载到 ~/.dsh/shisei/library。": "Read automatically from shisei.indaloop.app, nothing to set up, listing only items suitable for everyone. Only pictures you use in a project are downloaded to ~/.dsh/shisei/library.",
    "开机并开始计费？": "Start the GPU and begin billing?",
    "会在你的 compshare 账号上开机，按秒计费，从账号余额扣。": "This starts a machine on your compshare account, billed by the second from your account balance.",
