    "没货时每 2 分钟重试，等待期间不计费": "If none are available, it retries every 2 minutes; waiting is not billed",
    "开机后 ComfyUI 改为只监听本机，并从外网确认端口已关": "Once on, ComfyUI is set to listen only on the machine itself, and the port is confirmed closed from outside",
    "显卡自检失败会停机重开，最多 3 次": "If the GPU self-test fails, it stops and starts again, up to 3 times",
