    "动捕只跟踪画面里的第一个人；视频里有两个人？回首页选「换 2 人」": 'Motion capture follows only the first person in the frame. Two people in the video? Go back and choose "Swap 2 people"',
    "单人、全身入镜": "One person, whole body in frame",
    "参考图不变，每人的衣服描述可以分别改；旧的几条按原来的描述留着。": "Reference pictures stay; each person’s clothes can be changed separately. Earlier takes keep their descriptions.",
    双栏成片: "Two-panel cut",
    "双栏成片 · 1920×1080": "Two-panel cut · 1920×1080",
    双栏成片中: "Making the two-panel cut",
    双栏成片失败: "Two-panel cut failed",
