    右边的人: "Right-hand person",
    右边的人的衣服和鞋子: "Right-hand person’s clothes and shoes",
    "各条之间主要差在表情、眼神，以及两人有没有串": "Takes differ mainly in expression, gaze, and whether the two got mixed up",
    "同一段片段，只跑换人这一步。拍好的几条都留着。": "Same clip; only the swap step runs. The takes you have are kept.",
    实验: "Experimental",
    左: "L",
    左右对调: "Swap sides",
    "左右按片段第一帧里站的位置分：下一步会在第一帧上标出左右，标反了可以对调。两人交叉换位、贴身时，偶尔会把两套参考串在一起。": "Left and right follow where each stands in the clip’s first frame. The next step marks them on that frame and you can swap them if they are reversed. When the two cross over or dance close, the two references sometimes mix.",
    "左右按第一帧分。贴身或交叉换位时偶尔把两套参考串在一起，结果页逐条预审": "Left and right follow the first frame. Close contact or crossing over sometimes mixes the two references; the result page pre-checks each take",
    左边的人: "Left-hand person",
    左边的人的衣服和鞋子: "Left-hand person’s clothes and shoes",
    影棚白模: "Studio mannequin",
    "影棚白模 · {shot} · {head} · {n} 条": "Studio mannequin · {shot} · {head} · {n} takes",
    "按 4.5 秒片段估；下一步可选更长": "Priced for a 4.5 s clip; you can pick a longer one in the next step",
    "换 1 人": "Swap 1 person",
    "换 2 人": "Swap 2 people",
    "换 2 人时总是保留原背景：不动捕、不出白模，直接在原片上换两个人。": "Swapping 2 people always keeps the original background: no motion capture or mannequin, both are swapped on the source clip.",
    "换片段、人数或左右，要重新开一个项目：": "Changing the clip, the number of people or the sides needs a new project:",
    "换这一条重做双栏成片…": "Remaking the two-panel cut with this take…",
    "检查素材 →": "Check footage →",
    添加右边的人的全身正面: "Add the right-hand person’s full-body front picture",
    添加左边的人的全身正面: "Add the left-hand person’s full-body front picture",
    添加角色全身正面: "Add the character’s full-body front picture",
    添加角色脸部特写: "Add the character’s face close-up",
    背景: "Background",
    衣服和鞋子: "Clothes and shoes",
    视频里换几个人: "How many people to swap",
    "视频里有两个人？回首页选「换 2 人」": 'Two people in the video? Go back and choose "Swap 2 people"',
    角色全身正面: "character full-body front",
    角色脸部特写: "character face close-up",
    谁换成谁: "Who becomes whom",
    "起点挑两人分开站的一帧：左右按这一帧分。原画幅整段送去换人，不裁切。": "Start where the two stand apart: left and right follow that frame. The whole frame goes to the swap, uncropped.",
    "还差：{what}": "Still missing: {what}",
    这个人的衣服和鞋子: "This person’s clothes and shoes",
    "选两人一左一右、都抬头看镜头的舞蹈视频；画面里多于 2 人不支持。": "Pick a dance video with two people, one on each side, both looking up at the camera. More than 2 people is not supported.",
    "选抬头看镜头的舞蹈视频：舞者低头，角色也会一直垂眼。": "Pick a dance video where the dancer looks up at the camera: if the dancer looks down, so will the character.",
    "预审由看图模型抽帧比对两张参考图：左右认没认对、有没有互换、衣服有没有串。只写问题、不打勾；用哪条只由你点。": "The image model samples frames and compares them with both references: whether left and right are right, whether they swapped, whether clothes mixed. It only notes problems, never ticks; only you pick the take.",
    拾戏能做什么: "What Shisei does",
    "一句话，拍成戏。": "From one line to a film.",
    "短剧和翻拍，都在你自己的 GPU 上": "Short dramas and remakes, on your own GPU",
    你的角色: "Your character",
    "创作在左侧栏的「Shisei」页面里完成，也可以在 dsh 对话里说「用 Shisei 写个短剧」或「把这段舞换成我的角色」。": 'Create on the "Shisei" page in the left sidebar, or say "write a short drama with Shisei" or "swap my character into this dance" in a dsh chat.',
    "{n} 个角色，来自 {m} 个项目。": "{n} {n|character|characters} from {m} {m|project|projects}.",
    "画面和声音由 AI 生成": "Picture and sound are AI-generated.",
    "画面由 AI 生成": "The picture is AI-generated.",
    "· 每人一张全身正面": "· one full-body front picture each",
    "跳一段舞，换个角色": "Dance it, then swap in a character"
