    "这个项目还没有对标片。": "This project has no reference video yet.",
    "这台电脑没装 ffmpeg（本机处理视频要用它，不下载模型）。到 Shisei 的「设置」里点「安装 ffmpeg」，或在终端里自己装。": 'ffmpeg is not installed on this computer (it handles video locally; no model is downloaded). Click "Install ffmpeg" in Shisei settings, or install it yourself in a terminal.',
    "装 compshare-cli 要从 PyPI（pypi.org）下载，这台电脑连不上或太慢：检查网络或代理（开了代理的话确认它对 pypi.org 生效），再点安装。": "Installing compshare-cli downloads it from PyPI (pypi.org), and this computer cannot reach it or it is too slow: check the network or proxy (if you use a proxy, make sure it covers pypi.org), then click install again.",
    "装 compshare-cli 没有成功：展开技术细节看 pip 的报错；还不行就把它发给作者。": "Installing compshare-cli did not succeed: open the technical details to see what pip said; if it still fails, send them to the author.",
    "这台电脑没有 ssh 工具（OpenSSH 客户端），插件靠它登录 GPU 机器。Windows：设置 › 系统 › 可选功能 › 添加功能，装「OpenSSH 客户端」；装好后重启 dsh 再点。": 'This computer has no ssh tools (the OpenSSH client), which the plugin uses to log in to the GPU machine. Windows: Settings › System › Optional features › Add a feature, install "OpenSSH Client"; then restart dsh and click again.',
    "机器没有建成，也没有扣费：优云智算说账户余额不足。到优云智算控制台充值后再点。": "The machine was not created and nothing was charged: compshare says the account balance is too low. Top up in the compshare console, then click again.",
    "机器没有建成，也没有扣费：优云智算账号还没实名认证。到控制台完成实名认证后再点。": "The machine was not created and nothing was charged: the compshare account has not finished identity verification. Complete it in the console, then click again.",
    "机器没有建成，也没有扣费。优云智算的回答：{reason}": "The machine was not created and nothing was charged. compshare said: {reason}",
    "机器没有建成，也没有扣费。出错的地方：{reason}": "The machine was not created and nothing was charged. Where it failed: {reason}",
    "这台电脑上的 Python 用不了：没找到，或者版本太旧（要 3.9 或更新）。到 python.org 装 Python 3.12（Windows 安装时勾上 py 启动器和 Add to PATH），装好后重启 dsh 再试。": "The Python on this computer cannot be used: it was not found, or it is too old (3.9 or newer is needed). Install Python 3.12 from python.org (on Windows, tick the py launcher and Add to PATH), then restart dsh and try again.",
    "这台电脑的 ffmpeg 太旧，找不到切点（要 4.4 或更新）。升级 ffmpeg 后再加对标片。": "The ffmpeg on this computer is too old to find cuts (4.4 or newer is needed). Update ffmpeg, then add the reference again.",
    "ffmpeg 装完了，但还是找不到能用的 ffmpeg（要 4.4 或更新）。请在终端里运行：{cmd}": "The install finished, but a usable ffmpeg (4.4 or newer) is still not found. Run this in a terminal: {cmd}",
    "这台电脑没法在这里装 ffmpeg：{why}": "ffmpeg cannot be installed from here on this computer: {why}",
    "这是翻拍的作业，不是短剧项目。": "This is a remake job, not a short drama project.",
    "找不到这个项目：它的文件夹可能被删掉或移走了。回首页看看还有哪些项目。": "Cannot find this project: its folder may have been deleted or moved. Go back to the home page to see which projects remain.",
    "这个项目的 job.json 坏了，读不出来。": "This project's job.json is broken and cannot be read.",
    "先写片名。": "Write a title first.",
    "消息是空的。": "The message is empty.",
    "等太久没有回应（网络或机器太慢）。稍后再试一次。": "No response for too long (the network or the machine is too slow). Try again in a moment.",
    "网络连不上：检查网络或代理，再试一次。": "Cannot reach the network: check your network or proxy and try again.",
    "导演用的模型拒绝了密钥（401）：dsh 设置里模型旁的绿点只说明填了密钥，不代表能用。换一个能用的密钥或模型，再点重试。": "The director's model refused its key (401). In dsh settings a green dot only means a key is filled in, not that it works. Use a working key or another model, then click Retry.",
    "导演用的模型没有可用的密钥：到 dsh 的设置里检查默认模型和它的 API 密钥，再点重试。": "The director's model has no usable key: check the default model and its API key in dsh settings, then click Retry.",
    "导演用的模型这会儿被限流或额度用完了：稍后再试，或在 dsh 的设置里换一个模型。": "The director's model is rate-limited or out of quota right now: try again later, or switch models in dsh settings.",
    "导演用的模型找不到：到 dsh 的设置里重新选默认模型，再点重试。": "The director's model cannot be found: choose the default model again in dsh settings, then click Retry.",
    "这个问题已经不在了：导演可能已经停下或换了问题。": "This question is gone: the director may have stopped or changed the question.",
    "只能「允许这一次」或「不允许」": `Only "Allow this once" or "Don't allow"`,
    "这一步会开机计费，导演栏里不能允许：请用项目页底栏的按钮，那里有 GPU、可用区和价钱。": "This step would start the GPU and billing, so it cannot be allowed in the director panel: use the button in the project page's bottom bar, which shows the GPU, zone and price.",
    "这个问题已经过了等待时间，dsh 也不收迟到的回答了。请在导演栏直接打字回答。": "This question has timed out and dsh no longer accepts a late answer. Type your answer directly in the director panel.",
    回答的格式不对: "The answer is in the wrong format",
