    "{name}从画面左边换到了右边（上一镜 {shot}）：同一场里保持左右不变，要换就写明「反打」": '{name} moved from the left of the frame to the right (previous shot {shot}): keep left and right the same within a scene; to switch, write "reverse shot"',
    "{name}从画面右边换到了左边（上一镜 {shot}）：同一场里保持左右不变，要换就写明「反打」": '{name} moved from the right of the frame to the left (previous shot {shot}): keep left and right the same within a scene; to switch, write "reverse shot"',
    "{name}说这句时看向哪里没写清：写成「脸朝画面左/右侧（对方所在方向）」，不然模型常让人对着镜头说": 'It is not clear where {name} looks while saying this line: write "face turned to the left/right of the frame (toward the other person)", or the model often has them speak to the camera',
    "{name}说这句时看向哪里没写清：写成「脸朝画面左/右侧（对方所在方向）」，不然模型常让人对着镜头说。这一段首帧里是两个人，也可以用「侧脸相对」：drama-edit <目录> {shot} --staging profile": 'It is not clear where {name} looks while saying this line: write "face turned to the left/right of the frame (toward the other person)", or the model often has them speak to the camera. The first frame of this segment has two people, so you can also use "profiles facing each other": drama-edit <folder> {shot} --staging profile',
    "没有分段：每个镜头单独生成，切点处声音和表演会断开。把连续的 2–3 个镜头合成一段（5–12 秒）": "No segments: each shot is generated on its own, so sound and acting break at the cuts. Group 2–3 consecutive shots into one segment (5–12 seconds)",
