    "和优云智算（compshare）的连接断了（重试几次也没连上）。检查网络或代理，再点继续；已完成的步骤会跳过。机器如果开着会照常计费，空闲 10 分钟会自动停机。": "The connection to compshare dropped (several retries did not get through). Check the network or proxy, then click continue; finished steps are skipped. A running machine is still billed and stops by itself after 10 idle minutes.",
