    "这张首帧的预审看到裸露，而且人物像未成年：不能通过。重画、换装或裁掉，不要点通过。": "The pre-check saw nudity on this first frame and the person looks underage: it cannot be passed. Remake it, change the outfit or crop it out; do not click Pass.",
    "这一条的预审看到裸露，而且人物像未成年：不能选。换一条，或回到首帧重画。": "The pre-check saw nudity in this take and the person looks underage: it cannot be picked. Use another take, or go back and remake the first frame.",
    "{label}：心里话「{text}」的声音还没拍回来（上次运行中断了）。在底栏点「拍」补上，只拍缺的这一句；再合成。": "{label}: the voice of the inner line 「{text}」 never came back (the last run was cut off). Click Shoot in the bottom bar to make just that line, then cut again.",
    "{label}：预审看到裸露，而且人物像未成年，不能进成片。换一条，或回到首帧重画。": "{label}: the pre-check saw nudity and the person looks underage, so it cannot go into the cut. Use another take, or remake the first frame.",
    "{label}：有看起来年轻或未成年的角色，成片前必须先在页面上预审首帧和选中的 take。": "{label}: this project has someone who looks young or is written as underage; pre-check the first frame and the picked take on the page before the cut.",
