    "超出这个项目的上限：已花（估）¥{spent}，这次约 ¥{cost}，加起来比上限 ¥{cap} 多 ¥{over}。整段只拍 1 条，调高上限才能拍。": "Over this project's cap: spent (est.) ¥{spent}, this run about ¥{cost}, together ¥{over} above the ¥{cap} cap. The whole dance is a single take, so raise the cap to shoot it.",
    "超出这个项目的上限：已花（估）¥{spent}，这次约 ¥{cost}，加起来比上限 ¥{cap} 多 ¥{over}。这次少拍几条，或者调高上限。": "Over this project's cap: spent (est.) ¥{spent}, this run about ¥{cost}, together ¥{over} above the ¥{cap} cap. Make fewer takes this time, or raise the cap.",
    在逐镜核对: "Checking shot by shot",
    分镜要求看得出的状态对得上: "What the shot list says must be visible is there",
    分镜要求看得出的状态没画出来: "What the shot list says must be visible is missing",
    "{shot} 写了「{what}」，但这一段的首帧照 {first} 画、里面没有{obj}：开头就会少了它，到 {shot} 才凭空出现。在 {first} 写明要看得出它（state，如「戴着{obj}」）": "{shot} says 「{what}」, but the first frame is drawn from {first}, which has no {obj}: it will be missing at the start and appear out of nowhere at {shot}. Have {first} say it must be visible (e.g. wearing the {obj})",
    "{name}的画外音，但这一段没有拍到{name}：观众分不清是谁在说、谁在看。让{name}在这一段出镜一下（如窗外的背影），或者把这句交给画面里的人": "A voice-over by {name}, but {name} is never seen in this segment: viewers cannot tell who speaks or who is watching. Show {name} once in it (a back at the window, say), or give the line to someone on screen",
    "「{word}」这种细微表情视频模型演不出来：改成看得见的动作，如笑容慢慢收住、眼睛一眨不眨、手停在半空": "The video model cannot act something as subtle as 「{word}」: write a visible action instead, like a smile slowly fading, eyes that do not blink, a hand stopping mid-air",
    "{shot} 的心里话说画面「{what}」，这种感觉视频模型拍不出来，画面会和这句对不上：把 {seen} 写成看得见的样子（如笑着但眼睛一眨不眨、笑容一下子收住）": "The inner voice in {shot} says the picture is 「{what}」; the video model cannot film that feeling, so the picture will not match the line. Write {seen} as something visible (smiling with unblinking eyes, a smile that stops all at once)",
    "{list} 段换到新地方时直接硬切：可以在这些段前加开场空镜（lead_in：1–2 秒，用审过的场景图慢推，本机合成、不花 GPU）": "Segments {list} cut straight to a new place: add an establishing shot before them (1–2 s, a slow push on the approved scene picture, made on this computer, no GPU)",
    "两个人没有互相看着（有人看镜头）": "The two are not looking at each other (someone looks at the camera)",
