    "现在还不行，目前只支持优云智算。自带 GPU（本地显卡、vast.ai）已在路线图里。": "Not yet: only compshare is supported for now. Bring-your-own GPU (a local graphics card, vast.ai) is on the roadmap.",
    "只动你在 Shisei 里登记的机器：开机、停机、设定时关机。建新机器要你点写着价钱的按钮。从不删除机器或磁盘。": "Only the machines you registered in Shisei are touched: started, stopped, given a scheduled stop. A new machine is made only when you click a button that shows its price. No machine or disk is ever deleted.",
    "按平台标价付给优云智算，不经过 Shisei。每次开机前都会问你，写明显卡、可用区和价格；每个项目默认上限 ¥5，超了不开机。": "You pay compshare at its listed prices; nothing goes through Shisei. Before every start you are asked, with the GPU, zone and price; each project has a ¥5 cap by default, and nothing starts above it.",
    "{n} 位": "{n} {n|character|characters}",
    "1 · 连接 GPU 平台（优云智算）": "1 · Connect the GPU platform (compshare)",
    "GPU 平台签名校验": "GPU platform signature check",
