    "{gpu} · {zone}。可以先去写剧本，好了这里会变绿。准备期间这台电脑不会自动睡眠，别合盖。": "{gpu} · {zone}. Go ahead and write a script meanwhile; this turns green when it is ready. This computer will not go to sleep while it prepares; keep the lid open.",
