    "你要做的只有两件事：粘贴优云智算的密钥，确认建机器的价钱。导演模型、机器、环境由插件检查和准备。": "You only do two things: paste your compshare keys and confirm the price of creating the machine. The plugin checks and prepares the director model, the machine and its environment.",
