    "已经告诉导演：只照其中一段。": "Told the director: follow one stretch only.",
    "导演按它的节奏分段，只学镜头和节奏；每一步的价钱照常在「拍」那里报。": "The director splits the story to its rhythm, learning only camera work and rhythm. Each run is priced at the Shoot button as usual.",
    "有对标片时通常 3–10 分钟（导演照它的节奏分段）。写好后剧本会一段一段列在这里；这一步不开机，不花钱。": "With a reference video this usually takes 3–10 minutes (the director splits the story to its rhythm). When it is done, the script is listed here segment by segment. This step does not start the GPU and costs nothing.",
