    "在本机拆，只学切点、景别、运镜、光和节奏；每镜三帧的联系表会给看图模型和导演看。里面的人、台词和画面不进项目。": "Read on this computer for its cuts, framing, camera moves, light and rhythm only; a contact sheet of three frames per shot goes to the image model and the director. The people, lines and pictures in it stay out of the project.",
    "交给导演了：段 {label} 照{range}改。它会先说打算怎么改、哪些要重拍、大约多少钱；不会自己开机。": "Handed to the director: segment {label} is to follow {range}. It will first say what it plans to change, what has to be re-shot and roughly what it costs; it will not start the GPU itself.",
