    "拿一条你喜欢的短片当对标：在本机拆出切点、景别、运镜、光和节奏，导演照这个节奏拍你的故事。里面的人、台词和画面不会进项目。": "Use a short video you like as a reference: its cuts, framing, camera moves, light and rhythm are read on this computer, and the director shoots your story to that rhythm. The people, lines and pictures in it stay out of the project.",
    "视频只在本机，不上传 GPU，不花钱；最长 3 分钟。每镜三帧的联系表会给看图模型和导演看。": "The video stays on this computer: not uploaded to the GPU, free, at most 3 minutes. A contact sheet of three frames per shot goes to the image model and the director.",
