    "看图模型在看联系表 · {done}/{total}（这一步常要几分钟）": "Image model reading the contact sheets · {done}/{total} (this often takes minutes)",
    "没有看图模型。切点、时长和冷暖已经测好；景别这些点一下就行，也可以不填，导演按故事自己定。": "No image model. Cuts, lengths and colour are measured; pick framing and the rest with a click, or leave them and the director decides from the story.",
