    "视频只在本机，不上传 GPU；联系表给看图模型和导演看，不会当生成的参考图。": "The video stays on this computer and is not uploaded to the GPU; the contact sheets go to the image model and the director and are never used as generation references.",
    "段 {label} 照{range} 改": "Segment {label} follows {range}",
    "只学它的镜头和节奏：几刀、每刀多长、景别、运镜和光。人、台词和画面不会进来。": "Only its camera work and rhythm: how many cuts, how long each, framing, camera move and light. Its people, lines and pictures stay out.",
    "交给导演：它会先说打算怎么改这一段、哪些要重拍、大约多少钱，等你同意。": "Handed to the director: it first says how it would change this segment, what has to be re-shot and roughly what it costs, and waits for you.",
